<title>NETHERLANDS: IHC Caland first-half net profit falls.</title>
<headline>IHC Caland first-half net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>SCHIEDAM, Netherlands 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     1.46 vs   1.54</p>
<p>    Net profit			    34.9  vs  36.6</p>
<p>    Turnover			     780.6  vs 597.4</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    31.9  vs  35.7</p>
<p>    Net financial gains		  8.4  vs   7.6</p>
<p>    Income from associates	     0.6  vs   nil</p>
<p>    Tax					5.6  vs   6.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts expected ship builder and offshore equipment maker IHC Caland NV to post a first-half net of between 37.5 million and 47.2 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
